OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA day of sunny spells and
OL,6,Fscattered showers across the region.
OL,7,FSome of the showers will be heavy by
OL,8,Fthe afternoon, with the risk of hail
OL,9,Fand thunder. Not everywhere will see
OL,10,Frain. Feeling pleasant in the sunnier
OL,11,Fmoments.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers may ease for a time
OL,14,Fduring the evening, allowing plenty of
OL,15,Fbright spells ahead of dusk. Showers
OL,16,Flikely to return overnight, though
OL,17,Fmostly light in nature. Staying warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
