OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA cooler day, with sunny
OL,6,Fspells and a scattering if showers,
OL,7,Fthese mostly in the north. Turning
OL,8,Fincreasingly windy, with gales
OL,9,Fpossible over the highest hills.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,12,Fmixed few days to come, with sunny
OL,13,Fspells and scattered showers expected
OL,14,Feach day. Staying rather breezy, with
OL,15,Fa much cooler feel compared to of late.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
